File Index: 76 of 109
Audio ID: 7259632210649582908
Audio Duration: 4m 9.1s (249.10s)
Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-11-10 11:57:16 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 0.99)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,340] | Elapsed:  14.11s | Words: 14 | Text: 我20多岁的时候就已经有很多年的工作经验了
Segment #2   [00:00:03,340 --> 00:00:04,760] | Elapsed:  14.11s | Words: 7  | Text: 当时心想着创业
Segment #3   [00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:06,400] | Elapsed:  14.11s | Words: 8  | Text: 身边朋友能不能帮上忙
Segment #4   [00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:06,980] | Elapsed:  14.11s | Words: 4  | Text: 咱还不谈
Segment #5   [00:00:06,980 --> 00:00:10,880] | Elapsed:  14.11s | Words: 14 | Text: 突然发现很多人好像感觉无话可说了
Segment #6   [00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:12,360] | Elapsed:  14.11s | Words: 8  | Text: 连个同频的人都找不到
Segment #7   [00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:13,680] | Elapsed:  14.11s | Words: 5  | Text: 就很不理解
Segment #8   [00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:15,660] | Elapsed:  14.11s | Words: 11 | Text: 为什么他妈别人说的这种资源
Segment #9   [00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:16,840] | Elapsed:  14.11s | Words: 7  | Text: 我怎么就不具备呢
Segment #10  [00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:19,060] | Elapsed:  14.11s | Words: 10 | Text: 为什么很多人20多岁就有这种
Segment #11  [00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:21,080] | Elapsed:  14.11s | Words: 12 | Text: 装门门的意识和进去的思维
Segment #12  [00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:22,460] | Elapsed:  14.11s | Words: 5  | Text: 我怎么就不行呢
Segment #13  [00:00:22,460 --> 00:00:25,320] | Elapsed:  14.11s | Words: 12 | Text: 那个时候我就意识到一个很严重的问题
Segment #14  [00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:27,640] | Elapsed:  14.11s | Words: 8  | Text: 就是我和我的朋友们之间
Segment #15  [00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:29,320] | Elapsed:  14.11s | Words: 7  | Text: 好像从来都没有聊过
Segment #16  [00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:32,380] | Elapsed:  31.01s | Words: 13 | Text: 关于人生事业未来的这些话题
Segment #17  [00:00:32,380 --> 00:00:34,500] | Elapsed:  31.01s | Words: 10 | Text: 也从来都没有过彼此之间
Segment #18  [00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:37,020] | Elapsed:  31.01s | Words: 11 | Text: 挑毛病破冷水的这种经历
Segment #19  [00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:39,000] | Elapsed:  31.01s | Words: 10 | Text: 那你想想常年在一起还剩什么
Segment #20  [00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:42,400] | Elapsed:  31.01s | Words: 13 | Text: 追生梦死 吃吃喝喝 喝酒聚会呗
Segment #21  [00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:43,620] | Elapsed:  31.01s | Words: 8  | Text: 中心思想就一句话
Segment #22  [00:00:44,120 --> 00:00:45,660] | Elapsed:  31.01s | Words: 8  | Text: 拐弯抹角地炫耀自己
Segment #23  [00:00:45,660 --> 00:00:47,820] | Elapsed:  31.01s | Words: 10 | Text: 天佑家畜地去遍地别人
Segment #24  [00:00:47,820 --> 00:00:50,600] | Elapsed:  31.01s | Words: 9  | Text: 不然弄是非 互相复合
Segment #25  [00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:52,520] | Elapsed:  31.01s | Words: 11 | Text: 你细想不就剩这点破事吗
Segment #26  [00:00:52,520 --> 00:00:54,780] | Elapsed:  31.01s | Words: 11 | Text: 那这种圈子你说还能健康吗
Segment #27  [00:00:54,780 --> 00:00:56,480] | Elapsed:  31.01s | Words: 5  | Text: 你说给你偶尔
Segment #28  [00:00:56,480 --> 00:00:58,280] | Elapsed:  31.01s | Words: 9  | Text: 人前人后给你点面子
Segment #29  [00:00:58,280 --> 00:00:59,400] | Elapsed:  47.42s | Words: 8  | Text: 给你偶尔帮点小忙
Segment #30  [00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:02,020] | Elapsed:  47.42s | Words: 10 | Text: 这些东西对我们来说重要吗
Segment #31  [00:01:02,020 --> 00:01:03,340] | Elapsed:  47.42s | Words: 6  | Text: 现在可能感觉不重要
Segment #32  [00:01:04,340 --> 00:01:05,980] | Elapsed:  47.42s | Words: 7  | Text: 但是年轻的时候你会想
Segment #33  [00:01:05,980 --> 00:01:06,700] | Elapsed:  47.42s | Words: 3  | Text: 就够了
Segment #34  [00:01:06,700 --> 00:01:08,380] | Elapsed:  47.42s | Words: 8  | Text: 要的就是他们朋友们在一起
Segment #35  [00:01:08,380 --> 00:01:09,080] | Elapsed:  47.42s | Words: 3  | Text: 就是开心
Segment #36  [00:01:09,080 --> 00:01:10,360] | Elapsed:  47.42s | Words: 5  | Text: 我当然想的就是
Segment #37  [00:01:10,360 --> 00:01:12,000] | Elapsed:  47.42s | Words: 9  | Text: 只要玩的好的都是我好朋友
Segment #38  [00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:12,740] | Elapsed:  47.42s | Words: 4  | Text: 都是我兄弟
Segment #39  [00:01:12,740 --> 00:01:14,100] | Elapsed:  47.42s | Words: 5  | Text: 但是后来一想
Segment #40  [00:01:14,100 --> 00:01:15,660] | Elapsed:  47.42s | Words: 6  | Text: 真正缺少的是什么
Segment #41  [00:01:16,260 --> 00:01:19,080] | Elapsed:  47.42s | Words: 10 | Text: 是弹徒 是知识面 是事业
Segment #42  [00:01:19,080 --> 00:01:20,620] | Elapsed:  47.42s | Words: 8  | Text: 是对你善意的纠正
Segment #43  [00:01:20,620 --> 00:01:22,640] | Elapsed:  47.42s | Words: 9  | Text: 把有价值的亲身经历
Segment #44  [00:01:22,640 --> 00:01:23,420] | Elapsed:  47.42s | Words: 3  | Text: 分享给你
Segment #45  [00:01:23,420 --> 00:01:25,460] | Elapsed:  47.42s | Words: 9  | Text: 敢说你不好 敢跟你挑毛病
Segment #46  [00:01:25,460 --> 00:01:26,740] | Elapsed:  47.42s | Words: 5  | Text: 敢跟你破冷水
Segment #47  [00:01:26,740 --> 00:01:28,780] | Elapsed:  63.82s | Words: 5  | Text: 这个才重要 对不对
Segment #48  [00:01:28,780 --> 00:01:30,640] | Elapsed:  63.83s | Words: 10 | Text: 很多人说男人娶老婆成家
Segment #49  [00:01:30,640 --> 00:01:32,840] | Elapsed:  63.83s | Words: 6  | Text: 是一个很重要的事
Segment #50  [00:01:32,840 --> 00:01:34,700] | Elapsed:  63.83s | Words: 6  | Text: 一定要选一个好女人
Segment #51  [00:01:34,700 --> 00:01:36,040] | Elapsed:  63.83s | Words: 8  | Text: 因为她将决定你的一生
Segment #52  [00:01:36,040 --> 00:01:37,240] | Elapsed:  63.83s | Words: 3  | Text: 说错了
Segment #53  [00:01:37,240 --> 00:01:38,120] | Elapsed:  63.83s | Words: 5  | Text: 负责任的奖
Segment #54  [00:01:38,120 --> 00:01:39,180] | Elapsed:  63.83s | Words: 3  | Text: 朋友更重要
Segment #55  [00:01:39,180 --> 00:01:42,060] | Elapsed:  63.83s | Words: 13 | Text: 最佳的朋友是你人生战场的盟友
Segment #56  [00:01:42,060 --> 00:01:43,820] | Elapsed:  63.83s | Words: 9  | Text: 而不是说找一些人满足的
Segment #57  [00:01:43,820 --> 00:01:45,120] | Elapsed:  63.83s | Words: 8  | Text: 你平时缺险的需求
Segment #58  [00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:46,040] | Elapsed:  63.83s | Words: 3  | Text: 没事在一起
Segment #59  [00:01:46,040 --> 00:01:47,440] | Elapsed:  63.83s | Words: 7  | Text: 来 出来喝点小啤酒
Segment #60  [00:01:47,440 --> 00:01:49,080] | Elapsed:  63.83s | Words: 8  | Text: 出来玩一玩 出来逛一逛
Segment #61  [00:01:49,080 --> 00:01:50,520] | Elapsed:  63.83s | Words: 4  | Text: 那个是内好
Segment #62  [00:01:50,520 --> 00:01:52,000] | Elapsed:  63.83s | Words: 6  | Text: 所以说真正的朋友
Segment #63  [00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:53,120] | Elapsed:  63.83s | Words: 7  | Text: 是可欲不可求的
Segment #64  [00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:54,120] | Elapsed:  63.83s | Words: 4  | Text: 我们得珍惜
Segment #65  [00:01:54,620 --> 00:01:56,880] | Elapsed:  82.70s | Words: 11 | Text: 选择和我们不乏意志的人前行
Segment #66  [00:01:56,880 --> 00:01:57,540] | Elapsed:  82.70s | Words: 2  | Text: 如果没有
Segment #67  [00:01:57,540 --> 00:01:58,520] | Elapsed:  82.70s | Words: 5  | Text: 那我们就自己走
Segment #68  [00:01:58,520 --> 00:01:59,580] | Elapsed:  82.70s | Words: 5  | Text: 我们就一个人走
Segment #69  [00:02:00,220 --> 00:02:01,780] | Elapsed:  82.70s | Words: 12 | Text: 记不记得我前两天发的视频
Segment #70  [00:02:01,780 --> 00:02:02,840] | Elapsed:  82.70s | Words: 7  | Text: 我原话是怎么说的
Segment #71  [00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:04,160] | Elapsed:  82.70s | Words: 6  | Text: 不要带着朋友上路
Segment #72  [00:02:04,160 --> 00:02:05,960] | Elapsed:  82.70s | Words: 8  | Text: 而是要在路上找朋友
Segment #73  [00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:07,880] | Elapsed:  82.70s | Words: 7  | Text: 另外 你看现在这社会
Segment #74  [00:02:07,880 --> 00:02:09,240] | Elapsed:  82.70s | Words: 8  | Text: 他妈喝酒 成熊道地
Segment #75  [00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:12,160] | Elapsed:  82.70s | Words: 9  | Text: 白马子 利益而于我诈
Segment #76  [00:02:12,160 --> 00:02:13,160] | Elapsed:  82.70s | Words: 5  | Text: 今天杀小微猛
Segment #77  [00:02:13,160 --> 00:02:14,080] | Elapsed:  82.70s | Words: 6  | Text: 明天破口大麻
Segment #78  [00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:14,920] | Elapsed:  82.70s | Words: 6  | Text: 这不太正常了
Segment #79  [00:02:14,920 --> 00:02:15,660] | Elapsed:  82.70s | Words: 5  | Text: 哪有这件事
Segment #80  [00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:17,080] | Elapsed:  82.70s | Words: 5  | Text: 太多的人都觉得
Segment #81  [00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:18,700] | Elapsed:  82.70s | Words: 6  | Text: 哎呀 你们不行啊
Segment #82  [00:02:18,700 --> 00:02:19,460] | Elapsed:  82.70s | Words: 4  | Text: 你们不讲一起
Segment #83  [00:02:19,460 --> 00:02:20,640] | Elapsed:  82.70s | Words: 7  | Text: 我对你多好多好
Segment #84  [00:02:20,640 --> 00:02:21,820] | Elapsed:  82.70s | Words: 6  | Text: 你是我现在这样对我
Segment #85  [00:02:21,820 --> 00:02:23,200] | Elapsed:  82.70s | Words: 5  | Text: 等等等等这些问题
Segment #86  [00:02:23,600 --> 00:02:24,380] | Elapsed:  99.77s | Words: 4  | Text: 我问一问
Segment #87  [00:02:24,380 --> 00:02:26,060] | Elapsed:  99.77s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是凭目前的好朋友们
Segment #88  [00:02:26,480 --> 00:02:28,120] | Elapsed:  99.77s | Words: 6  | Text: 如果说咱们在一起
Segment #89  [00:02:28,120 --> 00:02:29,160] | Elapsed:  99.77s | Words: 5  | Text: 出哥们 出朋友
Segment #90  [00:02:29,160 --> 00:02:30,240] | Elapsed:  99.77s | Words: 6  | Text: 是用来帮忙的
Segment #91  [00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:31,160] | Elapsed:  99.77s | Words: 2  | Text: 如果是
Segment #92  [00:02:31,580 --> 00:02:33,080] | Elapsed:  99.77s | Words: 7  | Text: 你的目的如果不单纯
Segment #93  [00:02:33,080 --> 00:02:34,800] | Elapsed:  99.77s | Words: 9  | Text: 或者说你的亲王是跑偏的
Segment #94  [00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:36,020] | Elapsed:  99.77s | Words: 3  | Text: 朋友是什么
Segment #95  [00:02:36,020 --> 00:02:37,560] | Elapsed:  99.77s | Words: 7  | Text: 我感觉朋友们就是一起
Segment #96  [00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:39,060] | Elapsed:  99.77s | Words: 6  | Text: 互相审视自己的人
Segment #97  [00:02:39,600 --> 00:02:40,780] | Elapsed:  99.77s | Words: 6  | Text: 而不是取悦自己的
Segment #98  [00:02:40,780 --> 00:02:42,260] | Elapsed:  99.77s | Words: 8  | Text: 不是一味地付出取悦
Segment #99  [00:02:42,260 --> 00:02:43,140] | Elapsed:  99.77s | Words: 5  | Text: 到的是的绑架
Segment #100 [00:02:43,140 --> 00:02:44,820] | Elapsed:  99.78s | Words: 6  | Text: 我们也不要去考虑
Segment #101 [00:02:44,820 --> 00:02:46,240] | Elapsed:  99.78s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是我们现在的朋友
Segment #102 [00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:47,480] | Elapsed:  99.78s | Words: 7  | Text: 能不能和我们合得来
Segment #103 [00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:49,260] | Elapsed:  99.78s | Words: 6  | Text: 先相处一段时间
Segment #104 [00:02:49,260 --> 00:02:50,440] | Elapsed:  99.78s | Words: 4  | Text: 观察观察
Segment #105 [00:02:50,440 --> 00:02:52,520] | Elapsed:  99.78s | Words: 9  | Text: 你看看自己有没有变得更好
Segment #106 [00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:54,320] | Elapsed: 116.22s | Words: 6  | Text: 如果说没有一些改变
Segment #107 [00:02:54,320 --> 00:02:55,480] | Elapsed: 116.22s | Words: 6  | Text: 变得更差劲了
Segment #108 [00:02:56,220 --> 00:02:57,700] | Elapsed: 116.22s | Words: 8  | Text: 以前我一个星期喝三会
Segment #109 [00:02:57,700 --> 00:02:59,420] | Elapsed: 116.22s | Words: 8  | Text: 我现在一个星期喝五会
Segment #110 [00:02:59,920 --> 00:03:01,000] | Elapsed: 116.22s | Words: 7  | Text: 天天出了玩就是玩
Segment #111 [00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:02,800] | Elapsed: 116.22s | Words: 9  | Text: 那你这个圈子真的就是病态
Segment #112 [00:03:03,340 --> 00:03:04,720] | Elapsed: 116.22s | Words: 6  | Text: 朋友之间确实要
Segment #113 [00:03:05,320 --> 00:03:06,700] | Elapsed: 116.22s | Words: 6  | Text: 需要保持长时间的
Segment #114 [00:03:06,700 --> 00:03:07,760] | Elapsed: 116.22s | Words: 7  | Text: 这种舒适的关系
Segment #115 [00:03:07,760 --> 00:03:08,620] | Elapsed: 116.22s | Words: 4  | Text: 那怎么保持
Segment #116 [00:03:08,620 --> 00:03:10,480] | Elapsed: 116.22s | Words: 7  | Text: 不是天天在一起玩啊
Segment #117 [00:03:10,480 --> 00:03:11,920] | Elapsed: 116.22s | Words: 5  | Text: 是互相共影
Segment #118 [00:03:11,920 --> 00:03:12,840] | Elapsed: 116.22s | Words: 3  | Text: 互相这样
Segment #119 [00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:14,120] | Elapsed: 116.22s | Words: 4  | Text: 共同生辞
Segment #120 [00:03:14,120 --> 00:03:15,700] | Elapsed: 116.22s | Words: 6  | Text: 达到彼此能够
Segment #121 [00:03:15,700 --> 00:03:17,280] | Elapsed: 116.22s | Words: 6  | Text: 遇到更好的自己的
Segment #122 [00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:18,120] | Elapsed: 116.22s | Words: 4  | Text: 这种条件
Segment #123 [00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:19,260] | Elapsed: 116.22s | Words: 5  | Text: 所以这才是朋友
Segment #124 [00:03:20,040 --> 00:03:20,920] | Elapsed: 116.22s | Words: 3  | Text: 你包括我
Segment #125 [00:03:20,920 --> 00:03:22,340] | Elapsed: 116.22s | Words: 7  | Text: 我现在就喜欢几种人
Segment #126 [00:03:22,340 --> 00:03:23,500] | Elapsed: 132.25s | Words: 5  | Text: 可以给你们分享分享
Segment #127 [00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:25,180] | Elapsed: 132.25s | Words: 4  | Text: 喜欢三种人
Segment #128 [00:03:25,180 --> 00:03:26,740] | Elapsed: 132.25s | Words: 6  | Text: 一种是优秀的人
Segment #129 [00:03:26,740 --> 00:03:27,800] | Elapsed: 132.25s | Words: 3  | Text: 第二种是
Segment #130 [00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:29,560] | Elapsed: 132.25s | Words: 8  | Text: 可以让我变得优秀的人
Segment #131 [00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:30,660] | Elapsed: 132.25s | Words: 3  | Text: 第三种是
Segment #132 [00:03:30,660 --> 00:03:32,360] | Elapsed: 132.25s | Words: 7  | Text: 我们一起变得优秀的人
Segment #133 [00:03:32,940 --> 00:03:34,660] | Elapsed: 132.25s | Words: 7  | Text: 我们可以偶尔回头看
Segment #134 [00:03:34,660 --> 00:03:36,580] | Elapsed: 132.25s | Words: 8  | Text: 因为那个是情怀是回忆
Segment #135 [00:03:37,040 --> 00:03:37,740] | Elapsed: 132.25s | Words: 2  | Text: 但是啊
Segment #136 [00:03:37,740 --> 00:03:39,220] | Elapsed: 132.25s | Words: 6  | Text: 尽量不要往回走
Segment #137 [00:03:40,780 --> 00:03:41,700] | Elapsed: 132.25s | Words: 4  | Text: 今天在话题
Segment #138 [00:03:41,700 --> 00:03:43,300] | Elapsed: 132.25s | Words: 7  | Text: 可能聊到这怎么聊的
Segment #139 [00:03:43,300 --> 00:03:43,960] | Elapsed: 132.25s | Words: 4  | Text: 有点沉重
Segment #140 [00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:46,100] | Elapsed: 132.25s | Words: 9  | Text: 但愿我们事业不辜负谁
Segment #141 [00:03:46,100 --> 00:03:47,820] | Elapsed: 132.25s | Words: 6  | Text: 不管我们活成什么样
Segment #142 [00:03:47,820 --> 00:03:49,360] | Elapsed: 132.25s | Words: 10 | Text: 都不要把责任推卸给对方
Segment #143 [00:03:49,360 --> 00:03:51,360] | Elapsed: 132.25s | Words: 8  | Text: 一切都是我们自己选择的
Segment #144 [00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:51,840] | Elapsed: 144.06s | Words: 2  | Text: 对的人
Segment #145 [00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:53,700] | Elapsed: 144.06s | Words: 7  | Text: 对的人别错过错的人
Segment #146 [00:03:53,700 --> 00:03:54,300] | Elapsed: 144.06s | Words: 3  | Text: 别执着
Segment #147 [00:03:54,300 --> 00:03:56,820] | Elapsed: 144.06s | Words: 5  | Text: 感性的经营
Segment #148 [00:03:56,820 --> 00:03:57,900] | Elapsed: 144.06s | Words: 6  | Text: 我们曾经的交情
Segment #149 [00:03:57,900 --> 00:04:00,140] | Elapsed: 144.06s | Words: 9  | Text: 理性的对待我们的未来
Segment #150 [00:04:00,140 --> 00:04:01,300] | Elapsed: 144.06s | Words: 5  | Text: 以诚自之心
Segment #151 [00:04:01,300 --> 00:04:03,680] | Elapsed: 144.06s | Words: 11 | Text: 领教岁月的教会我们的东西
Segment #152 [00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:04,480] | Elapsed: 144.06s | Words: 6  | Text: 核心聚一句话
Segment #153 [00:04:04,480 --> 00:04:05,520] | Elapsed: 144.06s | Words: 5  | Text: 成为更好的人
Segment #154 [00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:06,500] | Elapsed: 144.06s | Words: 4  | Text: 加油莫生人
Segment #155 [00:04:06,500 --> 00:04:07,460] | Elapsed: 144.06s | Words: 6  | Text: 祝你们越来越好
Segment #156 [00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:08,480] | Elapsed: 144.06s | Words: 1  | Text: 加油
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
